<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Spanish</p>
<p>first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>12 -  Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>8  -  Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>7  -  Guilherme (Rayo Vallecano), Jose Ziganda (Athletic</p>
<p>Bilbao), Oli Alvarez (Oviedo), Juan Eduardo Esnaider</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid)</p>
<p>6  -  Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Gustavo Poyet</p>
<p>(Zaragoza), Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid), Alfonso</p>
<p>Perez (Real Betis),</p>
<p>5  -  Rivaldo (Deportivo Coruna), Alen Peternac (Valladolid),</p>
<p>Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid), Giovanni (Barcelona), Salva</p>
<p>Ballesta (Sevilla), Fernando Correa (Racing Santander)</p>
</text>
